<b>What's the point of this field trip guide book?
 Everyone has already been to Kyoto at least once.</b>

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:39.090
<b>What should I put down?</b>

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:43.010
<b><i>And besides, ever since I got back from the Southern island,</i></b>

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:47.640
<b><i>with all these going on at home and at school, I just can't concentrate.</i></b>

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:50.470
<b><i>Because of that, I've been tardy with my work.</i></b>

00:04:57.600 --> 00:04:59.110
<b><i>Tsukimura-san?</i></b>

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:04.450
<b>Would you like to see the stars with me tonight?</b>

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:09.330
<b>Sure!</b>

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:14.500
<b><i>At that time, surely, I was... with you...</i></b>

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:16.330
<b><i>But...</i></b>

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:20.500
<b>Stop being so reckless, spring onion boy!</b>

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:23.550
<b><i>I made a promise.</i></b>

00:05:24.460 --> 00:05:29.180
<b><i>I made an important promise with the girl
who called me the spring onion boy.</i></b>

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:34.100
<b><i>How did I forget?</i></b>

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:36.100
<b><i>It was such an important promise too.</i></b>

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:41.940
<b><i>But, if that girl really is Houjou-senpai...</i></b>

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:43.940
<b><i>I...</i></b>

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:47.150
<b><i>Come to think of it, Senpai back then...</i></b>

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:52.830
<b><i>No, it can't be!</i></b>

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:00.330
<b><i>Ninomiya-kun!</i></b>

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:05.880
<b><i>After that, they...</i></b>

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:10.840
<b><i>No, I have to stop thinking about things like that.</i></b>

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:16.930
<b><i>I've made up my mind that I'll do everything to spend
the leisure time during the field trip with Ninomiya-kun.</i></b>

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:19.310
<b><i>So, here goes.</i></b>

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:21.110
<b>Ninomiya-san.</b>

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:21.760
<b>Wha-</b>

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:23.230
<b>O-Okushiro-san?</b>

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:25.610
<b>Sorry for being late.</b>

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:28.650
<b>Hey, come on, Okushiro-san.</b>

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:30.280
<b>Have you decided on a nice place?</b>

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:35.620
<b>Well, no. By the way, you're from Kyoto, aren't you, Okushiro-san?</b>

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:36.870
<b>Do you know any nice places?</b>

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:41.710
<b>If you're asking me, then I recommend this one.</b>

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:43.130
<b>What's over there?</b>

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:45.590
<b>There are many nice hotels.</b>

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:50.640
<b>Would you like to relax with me
during the field trip leisure time?</b>

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:54.260
<b>Or would you like to come over to my parent's house?</b>

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:56.140
<b>No, that's...</b>

00:07:04.060 --> 00:07:05.400
<b>This time, for sure!</b>

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:07.940
<b>Ninomiya-san.</b>

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:14.700
<b>I know a really nice place to eat. 
Let's continue our business over there.</b>

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:15.870
<b>How does that sound?</b>

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:17.700
<b>Well...</b>

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:20.410
<b>Okay...</b>

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:26.000
<b>Okushiro-san is surprisingly daring.</b>

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:28.420
<b>Hinako-san!</b>

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:30.930
<b>There, there. First, calm down.</b>

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:36.800
<b>Okushiro Irori-san?</b>

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:40.770
<b>Honestly, I'm not really sure what kind of girl she is either.</b>

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:42.140
<b>Really?</b>

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:46.360
<b>Well, she's not the type that likes to stand out.</b>

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:51.900
<b>But, hidden underneath those glasses, is a great beauty.</b>

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:53.700
<b>Beautiful girl?</b>

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:54.620
<b>As I suspected.</b>

00:07:54.620 --> 00:08:00.450
<b>Well, at a glance.. she's rather plain and low profile.</b>

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:03.620
<b>But, it feels like she's hiding her true character.</b>

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:10.960
<b>And also, I know she has either
a cousin or a brother in another class.</b>

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:15.430
<b>Cheer up!</b>

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:18.390
<b>You're quite removed from what a real romance is like.</b>

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:25.890
<b>In that case, would you like me to talk to
Ninomiya-kun about the field trip for you?</b>

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:32.320
<b>But, I can't always depend on you to save me.</b>

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:34.150
<b>Being reserved now?</b>

00:08:34.150 --> 00:08:40.450
<b>It's not that. Regarding the leisure time,
it's just meaningless if I don't invite him myself.</b>

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:44.960
<b>Excellent. I guess that's part and parcel of love too.</b>

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:47.330
<b>Well, good luck. See you.</b>

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:51.420
<b>Hinako-san.</b>

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:03.850
<b><i>Don't tell me, it's already...</i></b>

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:15.740
<b>Are you all right, Tsukimura-san?</b>

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:26.710
<b>Good, Okushiro-san isn't around.</b>

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:31.920
<b>And what's worse, I've not been going home with Tsukimura-san lately.</b>

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:33.090
<b>Today, I should...</b>

00:09:35.210 --> 00:09:36.470
<b>There she is!</b>

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:37.510
<b>Tsukimura-san?</b>

00:09:38.380 --> 00:09:39.800
<b>You are...</b>

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:42.140
<b>Thank you for yesterday.</b>

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:45.350
<b>Are you feeling better now?</b>

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:47.100
<b>Yes, thanks to you.</b>

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:52.360
<b><i>Tsukimura-san who has androphobia,
is talking to a man other than me?</i></b>

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:55.440
<b>What?</b>

00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:58.110
<b>I'll see you later.</b>

00:09:58.110 --> 00:09:59.490
<b>Ah, okay.</b>

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:04.370
<b>Is Ninomiya-kun not ready yet?</b>

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:15.960
<b>Hey, Ninomiya Shungo-kun.</b>

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:18.840
<b>Welcome and enjoy the reception.</b>

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:22.720
<b>What are you doing, Inoue, Yoshida?</b>

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:24.100
<b>Wrong!</b>

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:26.180
<b>I'm the night party gang leader!</b>

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:28.850
<b>I'm the night party great king!</b>

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:31.810
<b>This is the secret base of operations of this party.</b>

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:33.900
<b>What the hell is that?</b>

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:35.570
<b>If you want something from me, then hurry up and say it.</b>

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:37.190
<b>Now we're talking.</b>

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:44.290
<b>For the coming field trip, the duty of handling
the sacred event has been handed down to us in Year 2.</b>

00:10:44.290 --> 00:10:48.830
<b>We'd like you to participate as well, even though you're part of the organising committee.</b>

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:55.880
<b>On the first night of the field trip,
we're going to sneak into the girls' rooms.</b>

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:57.050
<b>Sneak in?!</b>

00:10:57.050 --> 00:11:02.470
<b>It's the Jingu Academy field trip top traditional event, the Night Party.</b>

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:04.560
<b>We will have the honour this year.</b>

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:10.060
<b>I can't keep quiet and overlook an event like this!</b>

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:12.690
<b>Don't say that, Ninomiya.</b>

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:18.440
<b>This night party will reveal who's the most popular girl.</b>

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:19.990
<b>That's...</b>

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:22.650
<b>It'd probably be her, right?</b>

00:11:22.650 --> 00:11:27.080
<b>I'm sure 'this' and 'that' would happen to her.</b>

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:29.910
<b>Who would do that to Tsukimura-san?</b>

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:34.210
<b>In that case, you...</b>

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:36.420
<b>should be the one who sneaks into her room.</b>

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:47.930
<b>Why do I have to sneak into Tsukimura-san's room?</b>

00:11:53.390 --> 00:11:55.600
<b>Hey, Ninomiya Shungo.</b>

00:11:55.940 --> 00:11:59.320
<b>I'll be taking Tsukimura Mayu.</b>

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:11.580
<b>Why does one after another keep...</b>

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:17.960
<b>Ninomiya-kun?! Are you all right?</b>

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:21.840
<b>Hang in there! Ninomiya-kun?!</b>

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:36.980
<b>You really have no fighting spirit.</b>

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:40.480
<b>Why is it always me?</b>

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:42.190
<b>He just said something!</b>

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:43.490
<b>Never mind that, what's the diagnosis?</b>

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:46.990
<b>He's probably picked up a cold due to fatigue.</b>

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:49.580
<b>Though, he's still ten years too young to catch a cold from exhaustion.</b>

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:53.040
<b>But, we sure wasted a lot of time here.</b>

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:56.790
<b>Let's infiltrate some country to kill time then, Mikihiko.</b>

00:12:56.790 --> 00:12:59.920
<b>Let's go to a neighbouring country
and check out their nuclear facilities.</b>

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:06.930
<b>We have to be steadfast, right, Reika-san?</b>

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:09.970
<b>Is something the matter?</b>

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:18.980
<b>Ojou-sama, it's almost time for your
appointment with the sheikh of some country.</b>

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:20.190
<b>I know.</b>

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:21.900
<b>The helicopter will pick us up shortly.</b>

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:23.110
<b>I know.</b>

00:13:23.110 --> 00:13:26.360
<b>You're all going out too?</b>

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:29.240
<b>I wouldn't go if I didn't have to.</b>

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:30.990
<b>Because I want to take care of him...</b>

00:13:30.990 --> 00:13:36.250
<b>But, Ojou-sama, you have to remember your position as the heiress to the Houjou Corporation.</b>

00:13:37.670 --> 00:13:39.840
<b>We don't have anymore time.</b>

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:42.250
<b>Please forget about this man. We have to hurry.</b>

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:52.510
<b>Why are you behaving like that?</b>

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:58.730
<b>At times like this, you have to be
strong and do what has to be done.</b>

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:01.940
<b>If you don't, then I will...</b>

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:04.360
<b>I will?</b>

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:08.780
<b>Nevermind. I'm going now.</b>

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:14.870
<b>Either way, I have to try my best.</b>

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:20.130
<b>Man...</b>

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:24.300
<b>Why did that stupid sheikh have to pick such a bad time?!</b>

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:26.590
<b>She really isn't honest with herself.</b>

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:29.640
<b>Ojou-sama, why him?</b>

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:35.890
<b>Gently does it.</b>

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:47.150
<b>The fever still isn't going down.</b>

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:49.450
<b>I've gotta change the hot water bottle.</b>

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:56.160
<b><i>Tsukimura-san.</i></b>

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:01.540
<b><i>I remember this happening before.</i></b>

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:10.590
<b><i>Who are you?</i></b>

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:16.310
<b>If I don't wake up...</b>

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:20.310
<b>If I don't ever wake up...</b>

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:22.400
<b>then kiss me, okay?</b>

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:25.820
<b><i>Hey, stay with me!</i></b>

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:31.320
<b><i>Why? How?</i></b>

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:51.470
<b>Ninomiya-kun!</b>

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:57.100
<b>What was I...?</b>

00:15:57.100 --> 00:16:01.600
<b>That sweat... Don't tell me your condition has gotten worse!</b>

00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:05.480
<b>Ah, this is because I had a strange dream.</b>

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:08.820
<b>At this rate, Ninomiya-kun is...</b>

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:10.740
<b>Hey, I'm not really...</b>

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:12.610
<b>Ninomiya-kun is going to die!</b>

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:15.820
<b>Hinako-san, help me!</b>

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:20.830
<b>What to do? Why don't you try feeding him something that will give him energy?</b>

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:22.710
<b>Got it!</b>

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:26.250
<b>I have a bad feeling about this.</b>

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:31.670
<b>What in the world is this?</b>

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:35.260
<b>It's charred newt risotto to give you strength.</b>

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:41.980
<b>And, I also mixed in snapping turtle and ginseng X,
and stuff which tastes like an isotonic drink.</b>

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:44.190
<b>It'll definitely energise you!</b>

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:48.610
<b>I think the only thing getting energised would be one part of my body.</b>

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:51.610
<b>Here, say, "Ah."</b>

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:54.280
<b>Ahh.</b>

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:00.330
<b>I beg you, please eat it.</b>

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:05.040
<b>If you don't regain some stamina, then you'll really die.</b>

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:09.840
<b>I understand. I'll eat some.</b>

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:10.960
<b>I'll eat it.</b>

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:14.760
<b>Then, ahh!</b>

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:22.140
<b>How is it?</b>

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:23.680
<b>Are you feeling energised?</b>

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:25.810
<b>As I thought, it's just that one part.</b>

00:17:25.810 --> 00:17:27.940
<b>Then, it wasn't very effective...</b>

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:30.070
<b>Not at all.</b>

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:33.740
<b>It certainly had some effect.</b>

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:36.070
<b>Really?</b>

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:45.580
<b>You shouldn't do that Ninomiya-kun. 
You should rest properly by facing upwards.</b>

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:50.590
<b>I can't. Right now, being in this position is saving me, somehow.</b>

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:52.960
<b>That's strange.</b>

00:17:54.010 --> 00:17:56.590
<b>It really didn't have any effect.</b>

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:02.510
<b><i>Hello?</i></b>

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:09.770
<b>If that's the case, then I have just the thing.</b>

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:13.650
<b>Why do you have that syringe?</b>

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:15.650
<b>No, why are you in those clothes?!</b>

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:22.410
<b>This is Ryoko-san's special, medicine which makes one part of the body unbelievably rigourous and well fast.</b>

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:24.240
<b>You'll get better with just one shot.</b>

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:26.290
<b>If she injects me with that...</b>

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:30.290
<b>The injection may hurt a little.</b>

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:34.250
<b>Get better quickly!</b>

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:45.180
<b>8591 times 8592 is equal to...</b>

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:51.770
<b>I made him eat the special risotto, and also gave him the injection, but...</b>

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:54.860
<b>Ninomiya-kun isn't getting any better.</b>

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:55.650
<b>Yes.</b>

00:18:56.110 --> 00:19:00.200
<b><i>Ninomiya-kun is breathing heavily, and he's also sweating profusely.</i></b>

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:02.610
<b><i>He's also been slouching all this while.</i></b>

00:19:02.610 --> 00:19:05.580
<b>Slouching, you say?</b>

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:07.990
<b>What's maekagami?</b>

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:09.500
<b><i>Yes, slouching.</i></b>

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:12.250
<b><i>I'm sorry, I know you're busy.</i></b>

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:16.050
<b><i>So, I'll try my best on my own just like you told me.</i></b>

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:16.840
<b>Wai-</b>

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:19.010
<b>I never said that before.</b>

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:23.760
<b><i>That's right. For now, I should take off his clothes and dry the sweat, right?</i></b>

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:26.970
<b>Taking off his clothes?! Even though he's slouching?!</b>

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:28.890
<b>Why maekagami?</b>

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:29.480
<b>She hung up!</b>

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:36.320
<b>I'm going back. I knew that leaving this to her was a bad idea.</b>

00:19:34.350 --> 00:19:36.320
<b>Ojou-sama, please stay calm.</b>

00:19:36.770 --> 00:19:38.240
<b>What about him?</b>

00:19:38.240 --> 00:19:43.370
<b>Oh, Reika-san? Where <i>maekagami</i> ?</b>

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:46.870
<b>You don't have to dry the sweat, Tsukimura-san.</b>

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:49.700
<b>No, you musn't let your body get too cold.</b>

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:51.410
<b>I said no.</b>

00:19:56.630 --> 00:19:58.630
<b>I'm going to dry you now.</b>

00:19:59.170 --> 00:20:01.880
<b>Okay, please keep still.</b>

00:20:02.630 --> 00:20:04.300
<b>Scrub, scrub.</b>

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:10.640
<b>I have to dry you up properly.</b>

00:20:10.970 --> 00:20:13.310
<b>Else your cold will get worse.</b>

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:17.900
<b><i>The effect from the energy medicine is already putting me in an embarrassing situation.</i></b>

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:22.650
<b><i>But, if you add Tsukimura-san's succubus power in then, I can no longer... no longer...</i></b>

00:20:23.110 --> 00:20:26.160
<b>Now for the lower half of your body.</b>

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:36.670
<b>Ninomiya-kun, what are you doing?</b>

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:40.880
<b>You can't. It's so sudden.</b>

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:46.930
<b>You know that I'm a succubus, right?</b>

